<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>第一阶段：不构造成组合问题的动态任务选择</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>02 方法 · 阶段一</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>回答的问题只有一个：本周期哪些任务值得进入精细规划。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 620, gap: 8}}><Box style={{width: 620, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>① 基础优先级（五因素 min-max 归一）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>P_i = w_r·R̃ + w_u·Ũ + w_w·W̃ + w_s·G̃ − w_c·C̃；收益 / 紧迫度 / 等待补偿 W = 1 − e 的 −t/τ 次方（防滞留）/ 空间协同增益 / 粗执行代价。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 620, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>② 规模解耦：候选宜富、选择宜紧</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>n_cand = ⌈α·K⌉（α ≈ 2.5，能力无关，不被 cap(t) 砍塌）；n_sel = min(⌈max_ratio·K⌉, cap(t))；cap(t) = ⌊B(t)/c̃⌋，B(t) 只计可起飞子集剩余航程和。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 620, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>③ 边际纳入与防饥饿</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>eff = ΔB / (ΔC + ε) · (1 + γ·age) + b_forced；贪心追加至触达 n_sel；紧急 / 超时 / 故障释放任务绕过名额强制纳入，终刀仍受可行性约束。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 524, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 16, gap: 12}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>两道闸门只拒物理原因</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>prefilter：无机可用、逐机往返超航程才拒；异构口径下短程机装不下 ≠ 不可服务，更远的长程机可能装得下。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>postcheck：机群剩余航程预算；弹回不淘汰。时间窗迟到不是参选资格否决条件——软约束原则。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>输出：已选集 S，|S| ≤ n_sel。落选任务留池，带等待补偿参与下周期排序，不被静默丢弃。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 9, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>机制串联</Text><Box style={{width: 1136, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 6}}><Box style={{width: 186, minHeight: 44, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>按 P_i 排序</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 190, minHeight: 44, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>n_cand 候选（富）</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 188, minHeight: 44, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>闸门① prefilter</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 188, minHeight: 44, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>n_sel 边际纳入</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>→</Text><Box style={{width: 188, minHeight: 44, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'center' }}>闸门② postcheck</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>08 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>